[{"title":"登飞来寺示僧无名","author":"张吉","text":"山寺濒江俯江岸，游人今古纷无算。\n我是朝辞濛?湾，投宿空门夜刚半。\n鸡声喔喔度寒流，日出烟生晓凌乱。\n着冠束带蹑苔磴，道谒山僧来不缓。\n初登凡骨疑可仙，再登世态惊冰泮。\n扶倦终登最上头，心知手可扪霄汉。\n声声木末轰高唱，脚脚云头检清玩。\n刻玉铺金法相躯，碧狮粉象真宗伴。\n山僧煮茗供我毕，肺腑清如挹霜灒。\n听话萧梁奉佛年，象教辉光尤焕烂。\n不见江宁古佛宫，飞来远翥排空翰。\n梅关一角今尚在，来往行人得奇观。\n德僧茗饮耻僧言，掩面休辞赭面汗。\n下来独背松阴语，看汲清滩事樵爨。\n叹息山僧苦死迷，流沙弱水何漫漶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50439,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题故太保毗陵白公遗阯感物兴怀卷","author":"张吉","text":"太保勋庸垂鼎铭，黄钟大吕一毛轻。\n太保襟怀寄丘壑，玉田珠树相参错。\n丘壑灵风飒晓昏，悠悠过客总啼痕。\n他年学士把书卷，还泣名臣白公传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50440,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"露筋烈女祠","author":"张吉","text":"佳人翠袂映幽竹，风鬟雾鬓清如玉。\n崎岖一棹长淮曲，客子薄莫歌死鹿。\n盍离毒嘬即裀褥，此身誓死不受辱。\n天地黯黪鬼神哭，罗襦锦带深结束。\n泉源断绝贞心暴，姓名不假青史录。\n柔弱在貌刚满腹，幽光万古照祠木。\n男儿忍使纲常覆，过此不知何面目，哀哉此辈真禽犊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50441,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望庐山作","author":"张吉","text":"彭蠡之滨大江浒，群山耸立森圭珇。\n独有匡庐势最高，俯视一一如环堵。\n匡庐之峰真绝奇，青天割破愁神祇。\n崭岩百态应难状，钜衍三军劳并持。\n我来正值秋气改，浊浪翻空若浮海。\n贪看渐觉眼花添，欲上终疑筋力殆。\n却怪玄圭奏功后，历纪诸峰此峰漏。\n世儒虽辨敷浅源，恐将附赘为肤腠。\n嗟尔犹为神禹之所遗，自馀幽眇何由知。\n群山群山勿相疑，此峰微尔谁能窥。\n呜呼此峰微尔谁能窥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50442,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岳阳楼","author":"张吉","text":"巴陵县前春水生，古墙苔色鹧鸪声。\n主人锦盖团空翠，携我岳阳楼上行。\n楼上古像巾衣净，纯阳真人眠未醒。\n曾闻三醉作飞仙，颇恨不经微考證。\n明明孔道侔天日，敢将伎俩淆心性。\n设有虚空铁笛声，正宜掩耳防吾听。\n主人好怀靡休歇，清酤白粲杯盘洁。\n一眺平湖万里宽，澧兰薄暮吹香切。\n缘思帝子下青冥，逍遥极浦聊弭节。\n树轮茷骫山气黑，荪壁椒堂愁菀结。\n举觞欲酹惧非诚，愿遗我佩捐余玦。\n佩玦琮琤路杳茫，深烟密竹乱苍黄。\n歌钟未撤忧思积，凭楼一啸楚天碧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50443,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游桃川宫","author":"张吉","text":"板桥腐圬垂倾折，瘦筇缓度心凄切。\n仙家远在碧岑间，一犬寥寥山雨歇。\n遥看远树立如荠，上有阴崖下恶溪。\n黄冠说是秦人洞，路岐断绝不可跻。\n秦人种桃满阡陌，东风何事无颜色。\n恐是渔郎一梦馀，误劳数辈迷津客。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50444,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日谩兴","author":"张吉","text":"乌有先生著布袍，躯长八尺胆气豪。\n翩然骑鹤历九皋，笑谈霞表超蓬蒿。\n骖麟翳凤列仙曹，不徐不亟帝所褒。\n玉童婉娈鸾笙号，月瓢冷浴紫金膏。\n北斗杓星手所操，黄流倒泻沧海涛。\n安期巨枣金母桃，攫而食之侔啖芼。\n腰间珌琫金错刀，剸犀执象刲鲸鳌。\n下瞰八极了莫逃，秕糠扫荡轻于毛。\n悬车欹侧赤焰韬，先驱负弩旋旌旄，下来两腋风萧颾。\n君不闻龙井山头万株菊，寒香尽入高人腹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50445,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠温推府乡兄","author":"张吉","text":"江心微雨棹讴声，倚棹閒看春水生。\n美人遥忆武陵郡，戏挽桃梢绾醉缨。\n白纻成衣羽成扇，此日江亭卜相见。\n玉髯一别即三霜，叹息流年若惊电。\n君怀洒落与众殊，俯见寒潭秋月孤。\n故人骨瘦舌犹在，莫笑今吾非故吾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50446,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄日升东楼诗","author":"张吉","text":"太古神君眼如电，悠悠下瞰迷方面。\n凿开混沌施赤轮，楗旋万古摩天健。\n明星无明黯苍茫，仙山人世俱荒唐。\n忽然碧海生金柱，百怪屏迹群魔藏。\n先生握发谋端倪，非南非北还非西。\n盘据青阳俯生气，棼楣崭出隳虹霓。\n长风淡沲吹香陌，桃叶蓁蓁自春色。\n白云无数宿檐端，长啸一声天地窄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50447,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李文明员外出守岳州","author":"张吉","text":"春风吹空净如扫，使车缓轹东门草。\n法垣秋月十年孤，移向湖南照枯稿。\n湖南山色雨斑斑，铁笛仙人还未还。\n为道相思莫相及，鹧鸪叫断湘灵泣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50448,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀二首 其一","author":"张吉","text":"材薄知无补，微官负读书。\n梵宫金布地，歌馆玉为裾。\n钲鼓三城戍，桑麻万井虚。\n永怀愁绝处，孤烛夜分馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50449,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀二首 其二","author":"张吉","text":"天意知何极，疮痍苦未痊。\n西人方暴骨，东国尚侵边。\n忠谏须投窜，憸邪自保全。\n顾瞻犹寸禄，长使百忧煎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50450,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端午次韵答蒋世钦二首 其一","author":"张吉","text":"浩浩乾坤大，悠悠岁月过。\n西人张宴盛，北客感怀多。\n事靡投机括，名空玷网罗。\n好风知令节，吹到绕梁歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50451,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端午次韵答蒋世钦二首 其二","author":"张吉","text":"天涯牢落处，佳节暗经过。\n结客逢人少，耽书废事多。\n有茅堪酾酒，无葛未更罗。\n忽捧珠玑唾，何妨恣意歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50452,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣闷","author":"张吉","text":"我今真隐吏，聊可告人云。\n饵药袪炎瘴，观书远世纷。\n草庭卑可住，山鸟远堪闻。\n之子如相访，推窗啸白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50453,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独坐有怀董子仁苏文简","author":"张吉","text":"自笑南迁客，幽怀与物同。\n碧梧深院月，苍筱古坛风。\n道屈思求退，囊空不厌穷。\n美人何处望，瓠叶万层东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50454,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"镇南分司遇雨怀邵南庵","author":"张吉","text":"独坐观微雨，幽怀断复生。\n草英侵地软，竹色逼檐清。\n踪迹怜飘泊，经纶念老成。\n明朝一相访，疋马入孤城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50455,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和邵太守东台落成之什","author":"张吉","text":"高阁不可极，始登徵我人。\n苍生应有望，胜事岂无因。\n坐觉呻吟绝，何劳茇舍巡。\n兴来欢欲舞，先洒拂诗尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50456,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵南庵久雨之什","author":"张吉","text":"客子困积雨，萧条住百蛮。\n吾人安敢道，真宰独何颜。\n江涨浑无地，云深不见山。\n米囊探已竭，菜色几时还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50457,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再用前韵戏赠痴斋","author":"张吉","text":"曾闻天漏处，今日见南蛮。\n削尽睢盱态，添来憔悴颜。\n堰流思伐石，避湿欲登山。\n更假崇朝力，扁舟似可还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50458,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度岭","author":"张吉","text":"子夜饭孤馆，挑灯听越歌。\n百盘云磴外，三度笋舆过。\n近眼非星汉，钩衣祛薜萝。\n疏钟散清梵，僧舍奈明何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50459,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中偶题二首 其一","author":"张吉","text":"公事何时了，孤舟暑亦西。\n推篷坐夜月，伏枕听晨鸡。\n帆影凌风疾，人声傍水低。\n客怀殊不满，一醉拟前堤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50460,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中偶题二首 其二","author":"张吉","text":"江色不可极，客行东复西。\n絪缊随野马，嘲哳逐山鸡。\n渴罢茶烟细，歌阑扇影低。\n炎蒸堪一避，松叶韵长堤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50461,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东流","author":"张吉","text":"江北踏将遍，江南疋马初。\n白云山雨恶，红点岸花疏。\n小邑春惟寂，清樽夜不孤。\n风襜吹欲绽，久客愧为儒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50462,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"建德馆中次戴司寇韵","author":"张吉","text":"石径险疑断，畦樊缚欲斜。\n异花溪女鬓，深竹野人家。\n新旭荷天霁，纡途笑客差。\n煖云轻自散，片片傍巾纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50463,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重经南岳","author":"张吉","text":"沿湘仍望岳，身世更茫然。\n落影恐到海，飞岑疑造天。\n万峰都培塿，三界即神仙。\n共语人何在，题诗忆往年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50464,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿便水","author":"张吉","text":"漠漠烟村外，孤舟宿暮云。\n邮亭灯隐见，水国气氤氲。\n微月当篷露，啼鹃隔岸闻。\n客怀自今夕，谁叹久离群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50465,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卢溪僲岩","author":"张吉","text":"见说蓬瀛外，诸仙聚此岩。\n织缯馀旧杼，换骨弃空函。\n石险江流急，峰危鸟喙缄。\n茫茫天壤内，境界自真凡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50466,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿高都驿","author":"张吉","text":"江驿暮投宿，缘崖缆短篷。\n枕衾烟草际，魂梦水云中。\n役重民膏竭，年祲米价丰。\n忧时心未了，休访避秦翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50467,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵白沙先生送李世卿二首 其一","author":"张吉","text":"一尊沧海上，喜共大崖君。\n至道伤多故，奇文到几分。\n欲论真有得，端在屏虚闻。\n俗吏抛公案，逍遥弄水云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50468,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵白沙先生送李世卿二首 其二","author":"张吉","text":"江阁凭来久，新声传楚讴。\n二家未战胜，百氏总名流。\n母勿怜归鸟，郎今买去舟。\n中天望何许，碧玉海东楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50469,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萍乡偶书","author":"张吉","text":"萍实今何在，乡名犹未更。\n绳桥隳臲卼，土偶飒精英。\n客计歌狼跋，归心叹蚓萦。\n独看流水缓，花底有馀清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50470,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别后寄张应时同年","author":"张吉","text":"之子面如玉，沿流送我行。\n低回羸马缓，叶帖敝冠轻。\n岩邑经三宰，茆堂只数楹。\n野花开遍处，吟望若为情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50471,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袁河舟中二首 其一","author":"张吉","text":"客子驱车久，登舟似到家。\n端居巾袜静，稳卧梦魂赊。\n藤竹临清濑，鸬鹚聚白沙。\n幽怀写难尽，材薄独咨嗟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50472,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袁河舟中二首 其二","author":"张吉","text":"旧葛未全破，江船暑更登。\n滩清堪数石，鱼瘦忍张罾。\n老眼空眉睫，苍头讵股肱。\n故园虽咫尺，山月望中升。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50473,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚泊南浦驿","author":"张吉","text":"纷纷冠盖地，一去十年春。\n游子惭儿戏，诸生望后尘。\n问津閒荡桨，访旧欲沾巾。\n衣带飘迟暮，天南万里身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50474,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓发开建","author":"张吉","text":"开阳寒日薄，归袂拂云汀。\n主客编氓户，玄纁众鸟翎。\n兴添江阁近，喜脱簿书仍。\n奸蠹何由剔，残樽愧独醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50475,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行","author":"张吉","text":"晨起梳头罢，孤舟任稳栖。\n野蕉寒叶净，溪竹露梢低。\n寡欲宁忧瘴，言怀偶自题。\n片云江色外，閒领客心西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50476,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过封川","author":"张吉","text":"伐竹声犹在，悬车敛暝川。\n驿阴孤艇系，天际一人旋。\n摇落嗟何及，疮痍奈未痊。\n寒宵颇幽事，烧烛玩茶烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50477,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贾太傅祠","author":"张吉","text":"先生辞洛邑，谒见汉文年。\n内嬖何曾盛，中阉未弄权。\n谗邪犹易入，宠任己难坚。\n万古长沙庙，游人颇自怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50478,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杨志仁大参南宁别陈季广宪副诗卷","author":"张吉","text":"杨子罹谗网，南台幸有公。\n抗章申救力，腐竖拙谋空。\n樽酒昆崙北，片帆湘水东。\n珠光敚众目，传和入春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50479,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏调拙夫教谕病中","author":"张吉","text":"旧闻公善饭，近日颇相乖。\n倦怠惟高枕，将迎懒下阶。\n石湍喧客梦，山月照人怀。\n亭宇便幽事，真成吏隐斋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50480,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云山酌别张鸿胪次韵周宪长二首 其一","author":"张吉","text":"四国疲虓虎，微康幸此边。\n胜游方剥后，佳景未霜前。\n酌海金卮洞，团空翠盖连。\n日斜捐侈袂，幽洞访钧天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50481,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云山酌别张鸿胪次韵周宪长二首 其二","author":"张吉","text":"别瓮收江色，君哉古庙边。\n乾坤疑有外，宾从觉无前。\n帝业丹书隘，民居蔀屋连。\n九韶如眼在，今古本同天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50482,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和韵游东冈寺","author":"张吉","text":"倦借鸠藤力，跻攀俛复兴。\n太虚扪斗问，黄道趿云登。\n禅定灯犹续，诗成手自誊。\n戒心操己切，行者恐卢能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50483,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赴谪景东舟发龙窟赠诸送行者","author":"张吉","text":"一分新涨入花丛，醉眼摩挲认短篷。\n独鹤欲飞心万里，几人相送意千重。\n彼苍俯仰求无愧，吾道蹉跎尚未穷。\n数尺?毹春睡足，不知天际棹歌风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50484,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和李子长三洲岩韵三首 其一","author":"张吉","text":"嵌空亦借跂乌光，万里灵晖互短长。\n玉乳分香来石罅，芥舟潜影度坳堂。\n烟霞暂可栖凡鸟，松菊能无恋故乡。\n我有月瓢轻一尾，石桥曾掬几分凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50485,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和李子长三洲岩韵三首 其二","author":"张吉","text":"突兀支撑太古前，洞门临水锁蛮烟。\n曾经两度呼仙友，耻复终年堕世缘。\n虚室静谺云磴外，异花深拥玉池边。\n昆丘玄圃知何处，悬腕重挥忆旧联。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50486,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和李子长三洲岩韵三首 其三","author":"张吉","text":"小径通云谩百萦，乾坤谁斲妙空成。\n何人到了何人未，一步登来一步清。\n芝草琅玕同气味，鸾翔凤翥等心情。\n若论风景非人世，恍惚君山笛几声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50487,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崧台馆中","author":"张吉","text":"前驱顿节息传呼，再拜登堂坐绣铺。\n一代文儒非董贾，三年足迹遍江湖。\n敢忘稼穑酬艰食，自有菅茅葺敝枢。\n莫遣粤人歌夜半，令渠欹枕忆吴歈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50488,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答喻东之","author":"张吉","text":"春风昨忆到花期，送到藤阴某在斯。\n面目每家稽法相，端倪随处闯乾规。\n断金久扐同人占，作砭深陈抑戒诗。\n却笑阿舒真懒惰，何当椎鲁少开时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50489,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪藩臬诸寅谒帝尧庙二首 其一","author":"张吉","text":"律律荒山带浅流，维骖瞻拜古祠幽。\n帝仁本自同天覆，宗祀端宜到海陬。\n岩际未云先得雨，松阴当暑已惊秋。\n十年冠冕关心切，敢道归欤始胜游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50490,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪藩臬诸寅谒帝尧庙二首 其二","author":"张吉","text":"十里香尘送綵旃，庙檐虚阁午云偏。\n山龙藻火天衣静，玉帛牺牲岁事蠲。\n历数百王虽继统，大猷千古绝随肩。\n摩空翠壁侔嵩华，总是中天石一拳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50491,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再用前韵答陈季广宪副","author":"张吉","text":"晓拂彤幨逐胜流，野云深拥庙花幽。\n皇驰帝骤参乾运，桂海冰天亦近陬。\n缥缈衣冠延暑雨，凄凉祠宇飒寒秋。\n倚空金碧头陀院，感慨无端念此游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50492,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再答周汝诚佥宪","author":"张吉","text":"不见茅阶闪画旃，道垂终古绝奇偏。\n风雷鼓舞听犹静，江汉澄清玩未蠲。\n在物惟天堪作对，为君非舜莫齐肩。\n山中古庙来游日，击壤高歌乱有卷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50493,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孝庙挽章二首 其一","author":"张吉","text":"一德康邦竹再苞，周宣千古托神交。\n狂僧腐竖殷鈇锧，故老元勋席土茅。\n直节优容天广大，疮痍涵煦地并包。\n孤臣泣把求言诏，莫报涓埃愧斗筲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50494,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孝庙挽章二首 其二","author":"张吉","text":"听览躬亲积弊纾，何须戚宦力诛锄。\n文儒衮衮频登对，纪册滔滔不绝书。\n仁孝固应垂训远，励精无改继明初。\n万方洒血尤真宰，不遣天医下太虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50495,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵苏提学伯诚游白鹿洞五首 其一","author":"张吉","text":"滔滔泗水方堙阨，再浚渊源忆此场。\n躬率后夫寻坠绪，手扶休烈照遐荒。\n路穷绝顶知真永，月到中天敢议光。\n三字符今谁领会，先生筮得复初阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50496,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵苏提学伯诚游白鹿洞五首 其二","author":"张吉","text":"石磴萦回疋马迟，日高同拜大贤祠。\n国严党禁虽堪恸，天祐斯文岂便衰。\n汇泽波分天势远，匡庐峰接斗光比。\n小斋醉卧东风里，胜事频吹入梦思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50497,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵苏提学伯诚游白鹿洞五首 其三","author":"张吉","text":"白鹿呦呦亦几年，真儒挺出此开先。\n斯民没齿宗先觉，吾道垂光映后天。\n秦汉以来千百载，颜曾之后两三贤。\n谁将幻语惊聋瞽，谬指他途作正传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50498,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵苏提学伯诚游白鹿洞五首 其四","author":"张吉","text":"夫子何年去此峰，洞门长与白云封。\n经营今古伊谁力，检点乾坤第几功。\n乔岳倚空堕巀嵲，飞泉绕地沛流通。\n我逢再扫榛芜日，喜濯闾阎揖让风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50499,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵苏提学伯诚游白鹿洞五首 其五","author":"张吉","text":"独蹑名区慊旧闻，绕庭兰芷酿奇芬。\n滔滔瀑布源头水，冉冉香炉顶上云。\n古道倭迟犹往躅，残碑剥落尚遗文。\n我知昭代钦崇意，月户添修八万斤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50500,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]